      "description": "Nearby-object action with keyboard cue.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-inspect\" type=\"button\"><kbd>E</kbd><span>Inspect Smart Clock</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-inspect{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Atkinson Hyperlegible\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;min-height:50px;padding:11px 19px 11px 12px;background:var(--green,#3e5944);color:var(--paper-light,#fbf6ea);border:0;border-radius:7px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(39,46,30,.18);font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-inspect:hover{background:#304a35}.ds-inspect:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#31573a);outline-offset:4px}.ds-inspect kbd{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;flex:0 0 28px;border:1px solid rgba(251,246,234,.5);border-radius:4px;font:inherit}"
    },
